OL,3,AScam hotel booking sent family to
OL,4,AWetherspoon pub
OL,5,
OL,6,FA theatre-goer fell victim to a
OL,7,F"sophisticated phishing attack" after
OL,8,Fbooking a "luxury" London apartment,
OL,9,Fonly to discover the address was a
OL,10,FWetherspoon pub.
OL,12,FPaul Dawson, from Loughborough in
OL,13,FLeicestershire, paid #73 for a
OL,14,Fone-night stay for his family via
OL,15,FBooking.com at The London Crown
OL,16,Fapartments to watch the musical
OL,17,FHamilton in the West End.
OL,19,FDays later, he said, he discovered the
OL,20,Faddress shown in the listing was
OL,21,Factually The Liberty Bounds pub, a
OL,22,FWetherspoon near Tower Bridge.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,114,105,200,300,0,100
