OL,3,AScam hotel booking sent family to
OL,4,AWetherspoon pub
OL,5,
OL,6,FConsumer protection organisation Which?
OL,7,Fsaid Wetherspoon staff had been turning
OL,8,Faway up to 20 tourists a day after
OL,9,Fscammers used the pub's address as a
OL,10,Flisting for a "block of luxury
OL,11,Fapartments".
